  "reasoning": "As the first experiment, EfficientNet-B0 is the strongest pretrained backbone in the registry for audio spectrograms while still being compact enough (~5.3M params) for CPU inference within 90 minutes. Focal loss directly addresses the long-tail minority class problem by down-weighting easy/majority examples, and mixup regularization improves generalization on underrepresented classes. This establishes a strong baseline to iterate from."
